// Article 6. Dissolution.
#require "3-distributions.charter".
Extend Fact matter Identified by Dissolve
Bool dissolved
  Holds when Count(member) == 1
Power dissolve Actor company
  Valid when matter-unanimous(Dissolve)
  Creates dissolved
Input Fact debt Identified by string * usd
Act pay-debt Actor company Related to string, usd
  Holds when debt(string, usd)
  Creates cash(cash - usd)
  Terminates debt(string, usd)
Power wind-up Actor company
  Holds when dissolved && !(Exists debt: debt)
  Valid when dissolved
  Creates (Foreach capital: paid(capital.person, MulDivRound(cash, capital.int, total-capital, Floor)))
        , cash(cash - Sum(Foreach capital: MulDivRound(cash, capital.int, total-capital, Floor)))
Extend Act distribute Valid when !dissolved

Clause 6.1 => dissolved, dissolve
Clause 6.2/1 => debt, pay-debt, wind-up
Clause 6.2/2 => distribute.
